<title>UK: GOLF-WORLD MATCHPLAY SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD MATCHPLAY SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>WENTWORTH, England 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 36-hole</p>
<p>semifinal matches in the 650,000 sterling ($1.03 million) World</p>
<p>Matchplay golf championship on the 6,957-yard West Course at</p>
<p>Wentworth on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Ernie Els (South Africa) beat 4-Mark Brooks (U.S.) 10 and 8</p>
<p>Vijay Singh (Fiji) beat 2-Tom Lehman U.S.) at the 37th.</p>
</text>
